{"baseRefName":"main","body":"## Summary\n- Refresh the Nubia P0110 / pacific Android no-Host UI/UX evidence after origin/main advanced through PR #700.\n- Add retained evidence under `docs/changes/2026-08-22-android-ui-ux-audit/evidence/2026-09-08-nubia-p0110-no-host-uiux-after-700-current-main/`.\n- Update README and Phase 1 Android TEST pointers from the after-691 refresh to this after-700 current-main record.\n\n## Verification\n- Source/base: `HEAD == origin/main == be950a5e4e6c7415800f284b368d4b8cf6db3be8` before the evidence commit; `origin_main_is_ancestor=true`.\n- Android instrumentation on device `Nubia P0110 / pacific / Android 16 / SDK 36`: 87/87 passing, 0 failures, 0 errors, 0 skipped.\n- Focused JVM control-surface contracts: 19/19 passing across clipboard, file-transfer, and transfer-readiness boundary tests.\n- No-Host boundary retained: pre/post `adb reverse --list` empty; pre/post `lsof -nP -iTCP:54321 -sTCP:LISTEN` returned `status=1` with no listener rows.\n- Evidence integrity: `git diff --cached --check` passed before commit; `shasum -a 256 -c SHA256SUMS` passed for all retained evidence files.\n- Redaction check: no raw `REDACTED_ANDROID_SERIAL` serial remains in README, TEST, or the new evidence package.\n\n## Scope boundaries\nThis run did not launch Vibe Screen, MacHost, or Telemachus macOS GUI; did not run `swift run`; did not touch macOS TCC, Screen Recording, Accessibility, Microphone, Keychain, System Settings, or signing configuration; and did not create `adb reverse tcp:54321 tcp:54321`.\n\nThis remains Android-client no-Host UI/UX evidence only. It does not prove Host-backed product E2E, Android ClipboardManager <-> macOS NSPasteboard transfer, file-transfer bytes landing, LAN/Internet/video/input/reconnect/latency/soak behavior, Host signing/TCC readiness, native pointer, stylus, controller, iOS behavior, macOS hardware acceptance, or Xiaomi 13/fuxi evidence.","closedAt":"2026-09-08T15:07:04Z","files":[{"path":"README.md","additio